{
  "_comment": [
    "What each talent is worth to a character LEVELLING SOLO. Not a raid sim - a",
    "talent that is superb at 60 in a group can be worthless at 24 on your own,",
    "and the numbers below say so.",
    "",
    "Four stats, each a fraction added PER RANK:",
    "  power   - how fast things die",
    "  sustain - mana and health efficiency, i.e. how little you sit drinking",
    "  defense - how rarely a fight goes wrong",
    "  aoe     - whether you can pull three mobs instead of one",
    "",
    "These are judgement calls read off the tooltips in src/editions/forever.json,",
    "not measured values. They are meant to be argued with - that is the point of",
    "keeping them in a data file rather than in code. Change a number, re-run the",
    "races, see whether the build that wins changes."
  ],

